  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#link-type-tag\n\n> https:​//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhaetian_Railway_Gem_4/4\n\nshould be https:​//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhaetian_Railway_Gem_4%2F4 as otherwise the tag is just parsed as '4' \nIn fact, better to use https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhaetian%20Railway%20Gem%204%2F4 to have the tag parsed as 'Rhaetian Railway Gem 4/4' rather than 'Rhaetian_Railway_Gem_4/4'\n\nsee http://microformats.org/wiki/rel-tag#Encoding_issues\n",
